    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option D (\"Proceed immediately to the checkout registers\")\n\n• Acoustic & Textual Evidence:\nThe audio recording explicitly states: \"Dear customers, our store will close its doors in fifteen minutes. Please proceed right now to the central registers located on the ground floor to settle your purchases. Fitting rooms are now closed.\".\nChoice D accurately expresses the key information verified in the audio recording.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options & Refutations):\n  - Option A (\"Request a store voucher from customer support\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR]: This option is refuted by the recording: the speaker makes no mention of \"Request a store voucher from customer support\", but instead focuses strictly on the verified core purpose in the audio.\n  - Option B (\"Leave their clothing items inside the fitting rooms\") [INCORRECT - SECONDARY ACTION DISTRACTOR]: This option is refuted by the recording: the speaker makes no mention of \"Leave their clothing items inside the fitting rooms\", but instead focuses strictly on the verified core purpose in the audio.\n  - Option C (\"Evacuate the building without paying for goods\") [INCORRECT - CONTRADICTORY PURPOSE DISTRACTOR]: This option is refuted by the recording: the speaker makes no mention of \"Evacuate the building without paying for goods\", but instead focuses strictly on the verified core purpose in the audio.\n  - Option D (\"Proceed immediately to the checkout registers\") [CORRECT]: Accurately reflects the verified facts in the recording and directly answers the question asked."
